# Battle Arena Web Standards

- Keep this repo independent from API/mobile/infra.
- Prefer feature folders under `src/features` over dumping logic in pages.
- No hardcoded user-facing strings. Use `t('namespace.key')` for `en/fr/pt-BR/it/es`.
- TypeScript strict. Do not use `any` for API payloads.
- Do not commit copyrighted artwork. Remote demo sprites stay URL-only.
- Do not claim lint/typecheck/tests passed without running them.
- Never show technical API errors to players (timeouts with ms, HTTP status text, stacks). Use `toUserFacingMessage` — see `60-user-facing-errors.mdc`.
